OL,3,GNEWSAKent RAF veterans reunited by
OL,4,Achance after 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo RAF veterans have been reunited at
OL,7,Fa Kent care home after not seeing each
OL,8,Fother for 30 years.
OL,10,FIris Sheppard, 103, and Robin Green,
OL,11,F87, were both active members of the RAF
OL,12,FAssociation's Maidstone branch and
OL,13,Fregularly met at military events and
OL,14,Fremembrance services.
OL,16,FThey had not seen each other since the
OL,17,F1990s but were reunited when Green
OL,18,Fspotted Sheppard in the bistro at
OL,19,FCavell Park care home.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
