OL,3,GNEWSAKent RAF veterans reunited by
OL,4,Achance after 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen said he immediately recognised
OL,7,FSheppard, struck up a conversation and
OL,8,Fsoon discovered they were both living
OL,9,Fat the care home.
